.subckt lane__lane_rx_regenerative_frontend RXP RXN
+ TERM_EN0_N TERM_EN1_N TERM_EN2_N TERM_EN3_N TERM_EN4_N TERM_EN5_N TERM_EN6_N
+ VTHP VTHN RX_BIAS RX_BW_EN_N
